---
source: src/doc/tests.rs
expression: "parse_all(&[\"Inline $`\\\\sqrt{x^2}`$ math.\",\n\"$`a`$$`b`$ and $``a`b``$ and $` c `$\",\n\"Not math: \\\\$`x`$, $ `x`$, $`x` $, `x`$ and $`x`.\",\n\"[link $`x`$ text](u) and *$`y`$*\",\n\"| a | b |\\n|---|---|\\n| $`x|y`$ | $`z`$ |\", \"Before$`x`$after, and $`x`$5\",])"
---
== "Inline $`\\sqrt{x^2}`$ math."
P | "Inline " [$]"\\sqrt{x^2}" " math."
== "$`a`$$`b`$ and $``a`b``$ and $` c `$"
P | [$]"a" [$]"b" " and " [$]"a`b" " and " [$]"c"
== "Not math: \\$`x`$, $ `x`$, $`x` $, `x`$ and $`x`."
P | "Not math: $" [C]"x" "$, $ " [C]"x" "$, $" [C]"x" " " [$]", `x`" " and $" [C]"x" "."
== "[link $`x`$ text](u) and *$`y`$*"
P | [L1]"link " [L$1]"x" [L1]" text" " and " [I$]"y"
link 1: u
== "| a | b |\n|---|---|\n| $`x|y`$ | $`z`$ |"
Row(t0,head) | [ "a" ] [ "b" ]
Row(t0) | [ "$`x" ] [ "y`$" ]
== "Before$`x`$after, and $`x`$5"
P | "Before" [$]"x" "after, and " [$]"x" "5"
